 # Map queue recovery implementation seams
 
-Huginn source exploration: identify concrete refactor points in Tattler IPC/runtime, Pi event hooks, Chorus runtime/UI, Pi before_agent_start/sendMessage behavior, appendEntry durability, batch renderer shape, and test seams. Produce source-cited notes before implementation begins.
